{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22137","headline":"效陶潜体诗十六首 八 · 白居易","name":"效陶潜体诗十六首 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"家酝饮已尽，村中无酒酤。\n坐愁今夜醒，其奈秋怀何。\n有客忽叩门，言语一何佳。\n云是南村叟，挈榼来相过。\n且喜尊不燥，安问少与多。\n重阳虽已过，篱菊有残花。\n欢来苦昼短，不觉夕阳斜。\n老人[勿]遽起，且待新月华。\n客去有余趣，竟夕独酣歌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22137.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22137","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}